{"id":"c79b9c68c2400931","group":"67","path":"67/67-cor-sigma-no-delta-separator.md","title":"Sigma Implications Have No Delta Separator","display":"cor-sigma-no-delta-separator — Sigma Implications Have No Delta Separator","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-cor-sigma-no-delta-separator","aliases":["67-cor-sigma-no-delta-separator"],"display":"cor-sigma-no-delta-separator — Sigma Implications Have No Delta Separator","depends_on":["[[67-thm-sigma-conservativity-separation]]","[[67-df-partially-conservative]]","[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","[[67-df-PA]]","[[67-df-prim-provability]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","source_chapter":5,"source_label":"Corollary 5.1","source_printed_pages":[68],"source_pdf_pages":[79],"verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source statement and printed argument checked; full auxiliary formalization not independently reconstructed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-cor-sigma-no-delta-separator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-cor-sigma-no-delta-separator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-sigma-no-delta-separator — Sigma Implications Have No Delta Separator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"95d06fa2c54b0d9c\" href=\"?note=95d06fa2c54b0d9c\" title=\"67-thm-sigma-conservativity-separation\">67-thm-sigma-conservativity-separation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d04e3c8a5885c18\" href=\"?note=5d04e3c8a5885c18\" title=\"67-df-partially-conservative\">67-df-partially-conservative</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Corollary 5.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>79</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source statement and printed argument checked; full auxiliary formalization not independently reconstructed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 是一致的固定原始递归算术公理呈示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n\\)</span> 及相对公式类取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 为算术句子集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a> 的元语言有限可推导性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_n^T\">\\(\\Delta_n^T\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a> 的精确相对公式类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsSent}_{\\Pi_n}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsSent}_{\\Pi_n}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5d04e3c8a5885c18\" href=\"?note=5d04e3c8a5885c18\" title=\"67-df-partially-conservative\">67-df-partially-conservative</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\psi_0,\\psi_1\\in\\Sigma_n\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\;\\left[\\left(T\\vdash\\psi_0\\to\\neg\\psi_1\\right)\\land\\neg\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Delta_n^T\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\;\\left(\\left(T\\vdash\\psi_0\\to\\varphi\\right)\\land\\left(T\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\neg\\psi_1\\right)\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\psi_0,\\psi_1\\in\\Sigma_n\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\;\\left[\\left(T\\vdash\\psi_0\\to\\neg\\psi_1\\right)\\land\\neg\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Delta_n^T\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\;\\left(\\left(T\\vdash\\psi_0\\to\\varphi\\right)\\land\\left(T\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\neg\\psi_1\\right)\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源印刷68页/PDF79页推论1。取定理5(a)的两句。若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_n^T\">\\(\\Delta_n^T\\)</span> 中间句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>，可用其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 等价的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Pi_n\\)</span> 代表将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi_0\\to\\varphi\">\\(\\psi_0\\to\\varphi\\)</span> 沿第一侧保守性转移，得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\neg\\psi_1\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(T+\\neg\\psi_1\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span>；同理以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\neg\\varphi\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Pi_n\\)</span> 代表得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\neg\\psi_0\\vdash\\neg\\varphi\">\\(T+\\neg\\psi_0\\vdash\\neg\\varphi\\)</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\neg\\psi_1\\to\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash\\neg\\psi_1\\to\\varphi\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\neg\\psi_0\\to\\neg\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash\\neg\\psi_0\\to\\neg\\varphi\\)</span>，经典逻辑推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\psi_0\\lor\\psi_1\">\\(T\\vdash\\psi_0\\lor\\psi_1\\)</span>，与定理5(a)冲突。</p>\n<p>这里使用本书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_n^T\">\\(\\Delta_n^T\\)</span> 的精确定义，每个成员具有两种复杂度的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 等价代表；没有将该类擅自替换成任意布尔闭包。局部推导已核对，见证存在性仍继承定理5(a)的未完整重建限制。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-thm-sigma-conservativity-separation","status":"resolved","id":"95d06fa2c54b0d9c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-sigma-conservativity-separation]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-partially-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"5d04e3c8a5885c18","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-partially-conservative]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","